<Header /><main class="container" style="padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:80px;min-height:65vh"><h1>Your data. A clearer direction.</h1><img src="/assets/images/bi-dash-wordmark.svg" alt="Bi-Dash" width="300" height="64" /><p>Connect data, explore with SQL and create editable dashboard drafts from a prompt.</p><p>Use local Ollama or your own hosted-provider API key. Manage Admin, Editor and Reader access with configurable query timeouts.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/SlavchoSpasenoski/Bi-Dash">Get Bi-Dash</a> · <a href="/help/">Read the documentation</a></p></main><Footer />
</MarketingLayout>
